#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:1
msgid ""
"WikiToLearn is a community that aims to create free, collaborative and"
" accessible textbooks.\n"
"Our philosophy can be summarised as \"''Knowledge only grows if shared''\"."
msgstr ""
"WikiToLearn ye una comunidá que tien l'oxetivu de crear llibros de testu"
" gratuitos, collaborativos y accesibles.\n"
"La nuesa filosofía pue resumise en «'La conocencia namái medra si se"
" comparte'»."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:4
msgid "__TOC__"
msgstr "__TOC__"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:4
msgid "Conventions"
msgstr "Convenciones"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:7
msgid ""
"WikiToLearn makes extensive use of a hierarchy model, in order to create "
"books which are consistent with our philosophy."
msgstr ""
"WikiToLearn fai usu estensu d'un modelu per xerarquíes pa crear llibros "
"que seyan consistentes cola nuesa filosofía."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:7
msgid "Departments"
msgstr "Departamentos"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:10
msgid ""
"It's a collection of topics, courses and books belonging to the same area.\n"
"Departments are listed on the main page."
msgstr ""
"Ye una coleición de temes, cursos y llibros que pertenecen al mesmu área.\n"
"Los departamentos llístense na páxina principal."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:10
msgid "Topics"
msgstr "Temes"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:14
msgid ""
"They are the level underneath Departments and contain different courses"
" related to the same subject.\n"
"The topics are used to gather all the courses that explain the same theme,"
" because every university and faculty could have a different approach to the"
" subject.\n"
"For example, <code>Quantum Physics</code> may be a topic and <code>Quantum"
" Mechanics for graduate students</code>, <code>Advanced Quantum Mechanics<"
"/code> may be a course."
msgstr ""
"Son el nivel soxacente de los departamentos y contienen cursos diferentes"
" venceyaos a la mesma asignatura.\n"
"Los temes úsense pa recoyer tolos cursos que despliquen la mesa materia"
" porque cada universidá y facultá podríen tener un enfoque estremáu de"
" l'asignatura.\n"
"Por exemplu, <code>Física Cuántica</code> podría ser un tema y <code> Física"
" cuántica p'alumnos graduaos</code> o <code>Mecánica cuántica avanzada<"
"/code> podríen ser un cursu."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:18
msgid "[[<ref:FILE_37>]]"
msgstr "[[<ref:FILE_37>]]"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:18
msgid "Courses"
msgstr "Cursos"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:21
msgid ""
"These are the most important units of WikiToLearn.\n"
"Courses are collections of chapters, which gather the pages (sections).\n"
"Every course has the prefix <code>Course:</code> followed by the course name"
" in its URL."
msgstr ""
"Son les unidaes más importantes de WikiToLearn.\n"
"Los cursos son coleiciones de capítulos que recueyen páxines (seiciones).\n"
"Cada cursu tien el prefixu <code>Cursu:</code> siguíu del so nome na so URL."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:25
msgid "[[<ref:FILE_38>]]"
msgstr "[[<ref:FILE_38>]]"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:25
msgid "Chapters"
msgstr "Capítulos"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:28
msgid ""
"The lower level of a course.\n"
"They gather together some sections of a book and they are displayed as"
" headings in the main page of the course."
msgstr ""
"Unu de los niveles baxeros del cursu.\n"
"Recueyen dalgunes seiciones d'un llibru y amuésense como testeres na páxina"
" principal del cursu."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:31
msgid "[[<ref:FILE_39>]]"
msgstr "[[<ref:FILE_39>]]"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:31
msgid "Sections"
msgstr "Seiciones"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:34
msgid ""
"Sections are the basic unit of an entire course.\n"
"Basically, they're a single webpage with its own content."
msgstr ""
"Les seiciones son la unidá básica d'un cursu enteru.\n"
"Básicamente son páxines web individuales col so conteníu."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:37
msgid "[[<ref:FILE_40>]]"
msgstr "[[<ref:FILE_40>]]"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:37
msgid "Namespaces"
msgstr "Espacios de nome"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:40
msgid ""
"Namespaces are a mechanism for grouping pages.\n"
"You can see the namespace by looking at the url: if it has a <code"
">word:something_else</code>then \"word\" is the namespace.\n"
"In WikiTolearn there are two main namespaces, \"User\" and \"Course\"."
msgstr ""
"Los espacios de nome son un mecanismu p'agrupar páxines.\n"
"Pues ver l'espaciu de nome guetando na URL: si hai <code>pallabra:daqué</code"
">, si sí entós esi ye'l nome d'espaciu.\n"
"En WikiToLearn hai dos nomes d'espaciu principales, «Usuariu» y «Cursu»."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:40
msgid "User namespace"
msgstr "Espaciu de nome del usuariu"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:45
msgid ""
"The User namespace is your personal page where you can write your own courses"
" and content without worrying about making mistakes.\n"
"You can see an example here:"
msgstr ""
"El nome d'espaciu del usuariu ye la to páxina personal onde pues escribir los"
" tos cursos y conteníu ensin emolecete de cometer fallos.\n"
"Equí pues ver un exemplu:"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:48
msgid "http://en.wikitolearn.org/User:Grigoletti"
msgstr "http://en.wikitolearn.org/User:Grigoletti"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:48
msgid "Course namespace"
msgstr "Espaciu de nome del cursu"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-1.mw:51
msgid ""
"A Course namespace is similar to the User one, but it has the word <code"
">Course:</code>as a prefix to the URL<ref>URL is an acronym for Uniform"
" Resource Locator and is a reference (an address) to a resource on the"
" Internet</ref>.\n"
"This namespace is used to create an entire public course.\n"
"You can see an example on the English WikiToLearn:"
" [https://en.wikitolearn.org/Course:How_to_use_Linked_Data How to use Linked"
" Data]!"
msgstr ""
"El nome d'espaciu del cursu aseméyase al del usuariu pero tien la pallabra <"
"code>Cursu:</code> como prefixu na URL<ref>URL ye l'acrónimu pa Uniform"
" Resource Locator y ye una referencia (direición) a un recursu n'internet<"
"/ref>.\n"
"Esti espaciu de nome úsase pa crear un cursu públicu enteru.\n"
"Pues ver un exemplu nel WikiToLearn inglés:"
" [https://en.wikitolearn.org/Course:How_to_use_Linked_Data How to use Linked"
" Data]"


